    {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 8,
      "type": "dialog",
      "label": "KEEPER",
      "prompt": "PRESS E TO TALK",
      "dialog": "A WOMAN IN A NAVY JUMPER AND A YELLOW OILSKIN WAISTCOAT, GREY HAIR PINNED UP, A SPYGLASS IN HER LAP.\n\n\"MIND THE LENS. IT'S OLDER THAN BOTH OF US PUT TOGETHER.\""
    },
    {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 6,
      "type": "dialog",
      "label": "THE LENS",
      "prompt": "PRESS E TO LOOK",
      "dialog": "THE GREAT LENS: RINGS OF GLASS STACKED ROUND A COLD BLUE LAMP, TURNING SO SLOWLY YOU ONLY SEE IT IF YOU LOOK AWAY.\n\nONE PANEL ISN'T GLASS. IT'S A CUT SAPPHIRE, THE SIZE OF YOUR HAND - THAT'S WHAT TURNS THE BEAM BLUE. SCRATCHED INTO THE BRASS BESIDE IT:\n'SO THEY KNOW IT'S US. - E.G.'"
    },
    {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 4,
      "type": "dialog",
      "label": "SIGNAL LAMP",
      "prompt": "PRESS E TO LOOK",
      "dialog": "A SHUTTERED SIGNAL LAMP ON A TRIPOD, AIMED THROUGH THE GLASS AT MIDNIGHT ISLE, NORTH BY EAST. THE LEVER IS WORN BRIGHT.\n\nA CARD TUCKED IN THE STAND: 'THREE LONG, ONE SHORT. MORNING TIDE, COMING HOME.'"
    },
    {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 2,
      "type": "dialog",
      "label": "CLOCKWORK",
      "prompt": "PRESS E TO LOOK",
      "dialog": "THE CLOCKWORK THAT TURNS THE LENS. A WEIGHT ON A CHAIN DROPS THROUGH THE FLOOR ALL NIGHT; SOMEBODY HAS TO WIND IT BACK UP EVERY FOUR HOURS.\n\nTALLY MARKS ON THE CASE. A LOT OF THEM, ALL RECENT."
    },
    {
      "x": 7,
      "y": 2,
      "type": "dialog",
      "label": "LENS BENCH",
      "prompt": "PRESS E TO LOOK",
      "dialog": "POLISHING CLOTHS, A CHAMOIS, AN OIL CAN, AND A SPARE PRISM IN A PADDED BOX.\n\nA NOTE: 'GLASS IS CLEAN WHEN YOU CAN'T SEE IT. - DAD'"
    },
    {
      "x": 3,
      "y": 3,
      "type": "dialog",
      "label": "WINDOW",
      "prompt": "PRESS E TO LOOK",
      "dialog": "THE WHOLE SEA, AND THE BEAM GOING OUT OVER IT. FAR OFF NORTH BY EAST, THE DARK HUMP OF MIDNIGHT ISLE.\n\nYOU WATCH FOR A WHILE. NOTHING. THEN, JUST AS YOU TURN AWAY - A LIGHT."
    },
    {
      "x": 5,
      "y": 11,
      "type": "dialog",
      "label": "GALLERY",
      "prompt": "PRESS E TO STEP OUT",
      "dialog": "YOU STEP OUT ONTO THE IRON GALLERY. THE WIND TAKES YOUR BREATH.\n\nBELOW, SAPPHIRE PORT: LANTERNS ON THE QUAY, SMOKE FROM THE KILN, THE GALLEON CREAKING AT HER BERTH. ABOVE, THE BEAM SWINGS ROUND OVER YOUR HEAD, BLUE AND HUGE."
    },
    {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 11,
      "type": "dialog",
      "label": "GALLERY",
